@namespace PgmStudio.Client.Components

@* Everything the pointer can do to the map, floating at the bottom centre where the pointer already is.

   The dock holds groups, never loose buttons: a group is one question the tool answers (how do I get around ·
   what do I draw · what do I measure with), and the gaps between them are the only grouping a row of equal
   glyphs can carry. Groups wrap upward on a narrow viewport rather than scrolling sideways, so the last group
   is never the one that disappears. *@

<div class="canvas-dock">@ChildContent</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
